{"unit_id":"ly028716__dsh-memory-plugin#card-zh","repo":"ly028716/dsh-memory-plugin","commit":"4a630552b2e0355f7e85ed2be49b28501ae4fa06","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Memory Plugin 是一款面向 DSH Web 和 CLI 的本地记忆插件。它接入系统提示上下文、注册 memory 工具，并可在 Web 设置中管理采集与推荐。插件能够记录工具使用、用户偏好、项目上下文和会话主题，按类别搜索记忆、保存明确提供的信息，并根据上下文生成模型、Agent、命令或项目建议。适合希望在多个 DSH 会话间保留工作偏好与项目线索的用户。记忆保存在本地 JSON 文件；自动采集选项默认关闭，无需 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:23-25","index.js:67-85","index.js:161-224","memory-tool.js:123-140","config.js:8-30","storage.js:151-168"]}
{"unit_id":"ly028716__dsh-memory-plugin#card-en","repo":"ly028716/dsh-memory-plugin","commit":"4a630552b2e0355f7e85ed2be49b28501ae4fa06","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Memory Plugin adds local memory to DSH, including prompt context and a search and management tool. It records preferences, tool use, projects, and session topics, then suggests relevant models, agents, commands, or projects. Data stays in a local JSON file, and automatic collection defaults off.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:23-25","index.js:67-85","index.js:161-224","memory-tool.js:123-140","config.js:8-30","storage.js:151-168"]}
